{"post": true, "caption": "Leverage means trading with borrowed money. The part that is yours is called margin.\nIf price moves against you far enough to eat that margin, the exchange closes your trade for you. That is liquidation.\nRough rule: 100% divided by your leverage. At 10x, a 10% move does it. At 50x, just 2%. Most exchanges close you a little sooner, and fees push it closer.\nType LEARNED if this was new.\n\nEducation only. Not financial advice.\n\n#CandleAndCode #TradingForBeginners #MarketWords #Leverage #CryptoBasics", "tag": "MARKET WORDS", "footer": "Education only. Not financial advice.", "bpm": 100, "scenes": [{"type": "hook", "dur": 2.4, "size": 120, "lines": [{"t": "10x LEVERAGE.", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "-10% = ZERO.", "c": "red"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 2.8, "size": 88, "lines": [{"t": "That's called", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "liquidation.", "c": "red"}, {"t": "Here's how it works.", "c": "muted"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.0, "size": 88, "lines": [{"t": "$100 is yours.", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "$900 is borrowed.", "c": "muted"}, {"t": "$1,000 trade.", "c": "green"}]}, {"type": "stat", "dur": 3.0, "label": "Price drops 10% on $1,000", "value": "-$100", "note": "Your whole $100. Gone.", "c": "red"}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.2, "size": 84, "lines": [{"t": "So the exchange", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "closes your trade", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "for you.", "c": "red"}]}, {"type": "bars", "dur": 6.0, "title": "Drop that wipes you out", "subtitle": "rough guide, before fees", "rows": [{"l": "5x", "v": 20, "vl": "-20%", "lc": "fg", "bc": "red"}, {"l": "10x", "v": 10, "vl": "-10%", "lc": "fg", "bc": "red"}, {"l": "20x", "v": 5, "vl": "-5%", "lc": "fg", "bc": "red"}, {"l": "50x", "v": 2, "vl": "-2%", "lc": "fg", "bc": "red"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.0, "size": 92, "lines": [{"t": "More leverage,", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "less room", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "to be wrong.", "c": "red"}]}, {"type": "text", "dur": 3.0, "size": 92, "lines": [{"t": "Your stop-loss", "c": "fg"}, {"t": "should hit first.", "c": "green"}]}, {"type": "end", "dur": 2.2, "line": "Trade with a system, not a feeling."}]}
